          "message": "表面温度、上昇。行動速度、低下なし"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_006",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "観測情報を受領しました。熱属性への高耐性があります。現装備では追従性能も不足しています"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prologue_iron_ore_emergency",
      "name": "プロローグ05：鉄鉱床・設備転用",
      "status": "draft",
      "memo": "強制被害演出後。クレーン・照明ギミック開始前に自動再生。",
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "line_001",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "tense",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "設備監視装置と各機の自己診断を受信しました。採掘設備一基が停止、第二世代二機が重大損傷です！"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_002",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "損傷個体を遮蔽物の後方へ移動させます。クレーンと採掘照明の操作権限を要求します"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_003",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "surprise",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "現地設備を戦闘へ転用するつもりですか？"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_004",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "飛行経路を制限し、地上へ誘導します"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_005",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "tense",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "クレーンを損傷させた場合、回収作業へ影響が出ます"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_006",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "default",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "損傷を抑えます。現在、完全な保証は不可能です"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_007",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "tense",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "……了解しました。設備操作権限を接続します。必ず戻ってきてください"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_008",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "default",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "要求を受領しました"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prologue_iron_ore_aftermath",
      "name": "プロローグ06：鉄鉱床・戦闘後",
      "status": "draft",
      "memo": "大型飛行虫戦の勝利後に自動再生。",
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "line_001",
          "speakerId": "npc_2",
          "speakerName": "第二世代・測量機A",
          "type": "2",
          "emotion": "tense",
          "displayMode": "plain",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "損傷、重大。移動、不能"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_002",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "本機が回収します。稼働を停止せず、現在状態を維持してください"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_003",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "sorrow",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "任務目標は達成されました。ですが、受信した記録では採掘設備一基が停止し、同行個体二機が重大損傷を受けています"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_004",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "default",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "修復可能性を提示してください"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_005",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "sorrow",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "現在のデータでは判定できません。……修復可能だと回答したいです"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_006",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "confusion",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "希望は判定結果に影響しません"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_007",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "sorrow",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "分かっています。それでも、希望することまで停止する必要はないでしょう"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prologue_generation4_meeting",
      "name": "プロローグ07：第四世代との初対面",
      "status": "draft",
      "memo": "上層・整備区画。第四世代へ戦闘工程を移管する通知。",
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "line_001",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "tense",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "共同管理から配備更新が届いています。今後、高危険度任務における戦闘工程は、第四世代機へ段階的に移管されます"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_002",
          "speakerId": "placeholder_player",
          "speakerName": "主人公",
          "type": "3",
          "emotion": "confusion",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "本機の任務処理能力に異常が検出されましたか"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_003",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "sorrow",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "いいえ。あなたの性能は現在も基準値を上回っています。想定外の対象にも、あなたはすべて対処しています"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_004",
          "speakerId": "npc_4",
          "speakerName": "第四世代マギテック",
          "type": "4",
          "emotion": "serious",
          "displayMode": "plain",
          "portraitEffect": "none",
          "message": "本機からご説明いたします。テメェが最適な装備と戦術を構築するまでに、周辺へ被害が発生しているためです"
        },
        {
          "id": "line_005",
          "speakerId": "npc_6",
          "speakerName": "支援電子AI",
          "type": "3.5",
          "emotion": "anger",
          "displayMode": "portrait",
          "portraitEffect": "monitor",
          "message": "初対面でその呼称は不適切です"
        },
        {
